allowing disorders.", "CLAVE P:Clave P is a prominent researcher and author recognized for his significant contributions to the field of dysphagia, particularly in the area of swallowing therapies. He played a key role in developing the diagnostic and nutritional treatment guidelines for oropharyngeal dysphagia. Additionally, Clavé P co-authored an article on the nutritional approach to oropharyngeal dysphagia, which was published in the journal Nutrición Clínica en Medicina in 2007. His work has been instrumental in advancing the understanding and management of dysphagia.", "PUIGGRÓS C:PUIGGRÓS C is recognized as a co-author of an article focused on the nutritional approach to oropharyngeal dysphagia, which was published in the journal Nutrición Clínica en Medicina in 2007. Additionally, Puiggrós C contributes to the Spanish registry of home-based enteral nutrition and is actively involved in related research efforts.", "GONZALEZ R:Author of the article on dysphagia in neurological patients published in Rev Hosp Clin Univ Chile in 2009", "BEVILCQUA JA:Co-author of the article on dysphagia in neurological patients published in Rev Hosp Clin Univ Chile in 2009", "ETERKIN C:Author of the study on neurophysiology of swallowing published in Clin Neurophysiol in 2003", "AYDOGDU I:Co-author of the study on neurophysiology of swallowing published in Clin Neurophysiol in 2003", "HUGHES T:Author of the article on neurology of swallowing and oral feeding disorders published in J Neurol Neurosurg Psychiatry in 2003", "DUA KS:Co-author of the study on coordination of deglutitive glottal function published in Gastroenterology in 1997", "REN J:Co-author of the study on coordination of deglutitive glottal function published in Gastroenterology in 1997", "BARDAN E:Co-author of the study on coordination of deglutitive glottal function published in Gastroenterology in 1997", "XIE P:Co-author of the study on coordination of deglutitive glottal function published in Gastroenterology in 1997", "SHAKER R:SHAKER R is a notable contributor to the field of dysphagia research, having co-authored a review on oropharyngeal dysphagia in older persons, which was published in the journal Clinical Interventions in Aging in 2016. Additionally, SHAKE R co-authored a study focused on the coordination of deglutitive glottal function, published in Gastroenterology in 1997. These contributions highlight SHAKE R's expertise and involvement in advancing the understanding of swallowing disorders and their implications in different populations.", "MARTIN-HARRIS B:Author of the article on coordination of respiration and swallowing published in GI Motility in 2006"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}